<title>FRANCE: Rouen flour exports down in January.</title>
<headline>Rouen flour exports down in January.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from the French port of Rouen declined to 76,589 tonnes in January from 97,000 tonnes in January 1996, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Last month's flour exports included 28,376 tonnes for West Africa, 16,459 for Egypt, 10,500 for Sudan and 21,254 tonnes for Yemen.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
